                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pillar">
                                <h4>2. Trust</h4>
                                <p>
                                    Earned over time through reliable delivery. Includes both ability 
                                    (competence) and reliability (consistency).
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pillar">
                                <h4>3. Control</h4>
                                <p>
                                    Desired level of control varies with trust and task complexity. 
